# Real-environment test outputs (JUnit, logs, run-config, mocker
# stdout/stderr). All material under output/ is local-only and must
# not be committed. JUnit XML is excluded explicitly so XML reports
# from elsewhere (e.g. third-party tools) also stay local.
output/
*.xml

